:: Heist Investigators Widgets [widget]

/* ================================================================
 * Street event: Master's agents investigating the heist
 * Triggers when heist is reported and crime >= 5000
 * Behaviour scales with $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel
 * ================================================================ */
<<widget "streetHeistInvestigators">>
	<<initBankHeist>>
	<<set _al to $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel or 0>>
	<<if _al lte 0>>
		/* alertLevel 0: Watchers - atmospheric, no danger */
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		You notice a <<person>> in a dark suit standing perfectly still near a shopfront. <<He>> isn't shopping. <<He>> isn't waiting for anyone. <<His>> eyes sweep the street in slow, methodical passes.
		<<if $awarelevel gte 3>>
			<br><br>
			<span class="navy">Something about <<him>> sets your teeth on edge. The stillness. The patience. You've felt this kind of attention before. In the bank. In the vault.</span>
			<<awareness 1>><<gawareness>>
		<<elseif $awarelevel gte 1>>
			<br><br>
			<span class="purple"><<He>> doesn't look like police. Something about <<him>> feels worse than police.</span>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $skulduggery gte 600>>
			You spot a second one across the road, mirroring the first's behaviour. <span class="red">They're searching for someone.</span>
			<<if $awarelevel gte 2>>
				<span class="navy">You hope it isn't you.</span>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>
		<<destinationeventend>>
	<<elseif _al lte 2>>
		/* alertLevel 1-2: Approach and interrogation */
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<generate2>>
		Two figures in dark suits step out from either side of the pavement, blocking your path. The <<person1>><<person>> is tall, broad-shouldered. <<His>> companion, a <<person2>><<person>>, holds a small leather folder.
		<br><br>
		"Excuse us," the <<person2>><<person>> says. <<His>> voice is polite. Too polite. "We're conducting a private inquiry. A matter concerning the bank. You live in this area, yes?"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Try to slip away|Heist Investigator Flee]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 800>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Answer their questions|Heist Investigator Questions]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		/* alertLevel 3: Full chase */
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<generate2>>
		You hear the screech of tyres. A black car pulls up hard against the kerb. Three figures in dark suits pour out, moving fast, moving toward you.
		<br><br>
		The lead figure, a <<person1>><<person>>, points directly at you. "<span class="red">That's the one.</span>"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Run|Heist Investigator Chase 1]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Surrender|Heist Investigator Surrender]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

/* ================================================================
 * Bank event: Security encounter post-heist
 * Different flavor - corporate, cold, procedural
 * ================================================================ */
<<widget "bankHeistSecurityEncounter">>
	<<initBankHeist>>
	<<set _al to $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel or 0>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	<<if _al lte 0>>
		/* Clean heist - subtle unease */
		As you conduct your business, you notice a <<person>> in a grey suit watching from behind the glass partition near the service corridor. <<He>> has a clipboard. <<He>> isn't writing anything on it.
		<br><br>
		<<if $awarelevel gte 2>>
			<span class="navy">You recognise the service corridor. You were in there. The memory of the vault, the figure with the antlers, surfaces.</span>
			<<stress 6>><<gstress>><<trauma 2>><<gtrauma>>
		<<else>>
			<<He>> catches your eye and smiles. It doesn't reach <<his>> eyes.
			<<stress 3>><<gstress>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif _al lte 2>>
		/* Messy heist - direct questioning */
		You're halfway through your transaction when a <<person>> in a grey suit approaches the counter. <<He>> flashes credentials at the teller, who immediately steps aside.
		<br><br>
		"A moment of your time," <<he>> says. It isn't a question. <<He>> gestures toward a side office. "Routine security review. Won't take long."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Follow quietly|Heist Bank Security Questions]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Refuse and leave|Heist Bank Security Refuse]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<exit>>
	<<else>>
		/* alertLevel 3 - they're waiting for you */
		The moment you step through the door, two guards move to flank you. A <<person>> in a grey suit steps forward from behind the counter.
		<br><br>
		"We've been expecting someone like you," <<he>> says. "Please come with us. <span class="red">This isn't a request.</span>"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Go quietly|Heist Bank Security Caught]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Break free and run|Heist Bank Security Run]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 1000>><<physiquedifficulty 5000 14000>>
		<br>
		<<exit>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Heist Investigator Flee
<<effects>>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 6 "skulduggery">>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	You step sideways, casual as anything, and slip between two parked cars. By the time they react, you're already through a gap in the fence and cutting through a back garden.
	<br><br>
	<<bankHeistStealthCheck 5 "athletics">>
	<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
		<span class="green">You vault a wall and drop into an alley. Clean getaway.</span>
		<<stress -6>><<lstress>><<trauma -6>><<ltrauma>><<crimeUp 300>>
		<br><br>
		<span class="red">But they saw your face. They'll remember it.</span>
		<br>
		<<destinationeventend>>
	<<else>>
		You scramble over a wall but catch your foot on the top. You hit the ground hard on the other side.<<pain 4>><<gpain>>
		<br><br>
		You pick yourself up and keep moving. <span class="teal">They don't follow.</span> Maybe they got what they needed just from watching you run.
		<<stress -3>><<crimeUp 300>>
		<br>
		<<destinationeventend>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	The <<person1>><<person>> catches your arm before you've taken two steps. <<His>> grip is like iron.
	<br><br>
	"Running makes you look guilty," <<he>> says. "We just want to talk."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Answer their questions|Heist Investigator Questions]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Heist Investigator Questions
<<effects>>
<<set _al to $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel or 0>>
The <<person2>><<person>> opens <<his>> leather folder. Inside is a photograph. You can't see it clearly from this angle, but you catch a glimpse of a building. The bank.
<br><br>
"There was an incident at the bank recently," <<he>> says. "A break-in. Sophisticated. Professional." <<He>> watches your face. "You wouldn't know anything about that, would you?"
<br><br>
<<if $english gte 600>>
	<<link [["I heard about it on the news"|Heist Investigator Answer Good]]>><</link>> <span class="green">English</span>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="purple"><i>You know you could deflect this better if you were more articulate, but the words escape you.</i></span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[I don't know what you're talking about|Heist Investigator Answer Deny]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay silent|Heist Investigator Answer Silent]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Heist Investigator Answer Good
<<effects>>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 4 "skulduggery">>
"Terrible business," you say, shaking your head. "I bank there myself. Are my accounts safe?"
<br><br>
The two exchange a glance. The <<person2>><<person>> closes <<his>> folder.
<br><br>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	"Your accounts are fine," <<he>> says. There's a pause. "Thank you for your time."
	<br><br>
	They step aside and let you pass. <span class="green">You kept your composure.</span>
	<<stress -6>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<<else>>
	"Your accounts are fine." <<He>> studies you a moment longer. "We may be in touch."
	<br><br>
	They step aside. <span class="purple">You don't think they believed you entirely, but they didn't have enough to push further.</span>
	<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<</if>>

:: Heist Investigator Answer Deny
<<effects>>
<<set _al to $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel or 0>>
"I don't know what you're talking about," you say.
<br><br>
The <<person1>><<person>> tilts <<his>> head. "No? Interesting. Because we've been talking to people in this neighbourhood, and your name has come up."
<br><br>
<<if $english gte 400>>
	<<bankHeistStealthCheck 5 "skulduggery">>
	<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
		"People say all sorts of things," you reply evenly. "Am I being detained?"
		<br><br>
		Another exchanged glance. "No," the <<person2>><<person>> says. "Not today."
		<br><br>
		They step aside. <span class="teal">That was close.</span>
		<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>
		<<destinationeventend>>
	<<else>>
		"People say all sorts of things," you manage, but your voice wavers.
		<br><br>
		The <<person1>><<person>> smiles. It's not a kind smile. "They do. And some of those things are very specific." <<He>> produces a second photograph. This one shows the east side of the bank. The maintenance hatch.
		<br><br>
		"We'll be watching," <<he>> says. They leave.
		<<stress 12>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
		<br><br>
		<<destinationeventend>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if _al gte 2>>
		Your denial sounds flat even to your own ears. The <<person1>><<person>> produces a second photograph. The maintenance hatch on the east wall.
		<br><br>
		"We know someone went through here," <<he>> says. "And we know they had help. Names, faces... we're putting it together."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> leans in. "Last chance. Who planned it?"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Say nothing|Heist Investigator Arrested]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Say I want a lawyer|Heist Investigator Arrested]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		"Hmm." The <<person2>><<person>> makes a note. "We'll be in touch."
		<br><br>
		They leave. <span class="purple">Your hands are shaking.</span>
		<<stress 12>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
		<br><br>
		<<destinationeventend>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Heist Investigator Answer Silent
<<effects>>
You say nothing. The silence stretches.
<br><br>
The <<person1>><<person>> studies you. "Silence is an answer too," <<he>> says.
<br><br>
<<set _al to $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel or 0>>
<<if _al gte 2>>
	The <<person2>><<person>> closes <<his>> folder. "We have enough. Come with us."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Heist Investigator Arrested]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	They exchange a look, then step aside. "We'll see you again," the <<person2>><<person>> says.
	<<stress 12>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<</if>>

:: Heist Investigator Arrested
<<effects>>
They take your arms. Not roughly, not gently. Professionally. The black car is still at the kerb. You're guided into the back seat.
<br><br>
The drive is silent. You're not taken to the police station. You're taken somewhere else. Somewhere with no sign on the door.
<br><br>
After hours of questions you can't answer and threats you can't counter, they hand you over to the police.<<stress 24>><<trauma 18>>
<br><br>
<span class="red">You've been arrested.</span>
<br><<crimeUp 2000>>
<<link [[Next|Police Prison Intro]]>><<endevent>><<pass 30>><<generatePolice 1>><<generatePolice 2>><</link>>

:: Heist Investigator Chase 1
<<effects>>
You bolt. Instinct takes over. The streets blur.
<br><br>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 6 "athletics">>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	<span class="green">You're fast.</span> You cut left through a market crowd, weaving between stalls. Shouts behind you, but fading.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Keep running|Heist Investigator Chase 2]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You sprint hard but they're faster. One of them is nearing you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Duck into an alley|Heist Investigator Chase Alley]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Try to lose them in the crowd|Heist Investigator Chase Crowd]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Heist Investigator Chase 2
<<effects>>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 5 "skulduggery">>
You need to disappear. Running isn't enough. They'll have more people, more cars.
<br><br>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	You spot a construction site. Scaffolding, tarpaulins, a gap in the fence. You slide through and press yourself flat behind a skip. Footsteps thunder past.
	<br><br>
	<<bankHeistStealthCheck 4 "science">>
	<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
		You notice the scaffolding connects to a drainage pipe that runs down to the storm drains. <span class="green">You could use it to disappear completely.</span>
		<br><br>
		You wait until the footsteps fade, then climb down. By the time they double back, you're underground and gone.<<stress -12>><<trauma -6>><<crimeUp 300>><<llstress>><<lltrauma>>
		<br><br>
		<span class="green">You escaped.</span>
		<br>
		<<destinationeventend>>
	<<else>>
		You wait behind the skip, heart hammering. Minutes pass. The footsteps don't return.<<stress -6>><<trauma -3>><<crimeUp 300>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
		<br><br>
		<span class="teal">You escaped. Barely.</span>
		<br>
		<<destinationeventend>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You try to squeeze through a gap but your clothes snag. You tear free but the delay costs you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Climb the scaffolding|Heist Investigator Chase Climb]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 1000>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Hide behind the skip|Heist Investigator Chase Hide]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Heist Investigator Chase Alley
<<effects>>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 7 "skulduggery">>
You cut hard into a narrow alley. Bins, fire escapes, the smell of grease.
<br><br>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	You find a recessed doorway and press yourself into it. The pursuers run past the alley entrance without looking.<<stress -6>><<crimeUp 300>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<span class="green">They missed you.</span>
	<br>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<<else>>
	Dead end. A chain-link fence, too high to climb quickly. You turn. The <<person1>><<person>> blocks the alley entrance.
	<br><br>
	"Nowhere left to run," <<he>> says.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Heist Investigator Arrested]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Heist Investigator Chase Crowd
<<effects>>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 6 "skulduggery">>
You push into the densest part of the crowd, hunching low, changing direction twice.
<br><br>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	You duck into a shop and out the back door. Through a loading bay, over a wall, and into a residential street.<<stress -9>><<trauma -3>><<crimeUp 300>><<llstress>><<ltrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<span class="green">You lost them.</span>
	<br>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<<else>>
	A hand clamps onto your shoulder from behind. "Don't make this harder."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Heist Investigator Arrested]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Heist Investigator Chase Climb
<<effects>>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 7 "athletics">>
You grab the scaffolding and haul yourself up. Pipes clang beneath your feet.
<br><br>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	You reach the rooftop and sprint across it. The gap to the next building is narrow. You jump, and make it.
	<br><br>
	Below, you hear swearing. They can't follow.<<stress -12>><<trauma -6>><<crimeUp 300>><<llstress>><<lltrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<span class="green">You're free.</span>
	<br>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<<else>>
	Your foot slips on a wet bar. You catch yourself, but the delay is enough. A hand grabs your ankle.
	<br><br>
	"Come down. Now."<<pain 8>><<gggpain>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Heist Investigator Arrested]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Heist Investigator Chase Hide
<<effects>>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 7 "skulduggery">>
You duck behind the skip and press yourself flat against the concrete.
<br><br>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	Footsteps approach. Slow. Searching. They check the other side of the skip. A torch beam sweeps above your head.
	<br><br>
	"Not here," someone says. The footsteps move on.
	<br><br>
	You wait a full five minutes before you move. <span class="green">They're gone.</span>
	<<stress -9>><<trauma -6>><<crimeUp 300>>
	<br><br>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<<else>>
	A torch beam finds you immediately. "There."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Heist Investigator Arrested]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Heist Investigator Surrender
<<effects>>
You raise your hands. There's no point running from three of them.
<br><br>
The <<person1>><<person>> nods. "Smart."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Heist Investigator Arrested]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Bank Security Questions
<<effects>>
The office is small and windowless. The <<person>> sits across from you, folder open. A camera blinks red in the corner.
<br><br>
"This won't take long," <<he>> says. "We're reviewing all clients who visited the branch around the time of the incident. Standard procedure."
<br><br>
<<He>> asks about your account, your visiting patterns, your reason for banking here. Then:
<span class="red">"Have you ever noticed anything unusual about the service corridors? The maintenance areas?"</span>
<br><br>
<<if $english gte 600>>
	<<link [[I wouldn't know where those are|Heist Bank Security Answer Good]]>><</link>> <span class="green">English</span>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="purple"><i>You wish you could sound more convincing, but the right words won't come.</i></span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[No, nothing|Heist Bank Security Answer Deny]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay silent|Heist Bank Security Answer Silent]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Heist Bank Security Answer Good
<<effects>>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 4 "skulduggery">>
"Service corridors?" You furrow your brow. "I just use the counter like everyone else. Is there a problem with my account?"
<br><br>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	<<He>> studies you for a long moment, then closes the folder. "No. Your account is in perfect order." <<He>> stands. "Thank you for your cooperation."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> opens the door. <span class="green">You walk out calmly. Nothing to worry about.</span>
	<<stress -6>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|High Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<He>> watches you carefully. "Mmhm." <<He>> makes a note. "We'll be reviewing footage. If anything jogs your memory, you know where to find us."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> opens the door. <span class="purple">You're free to go, but you feel eyes on your back all the way out.</span>
	<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|High Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Heist Bank Security Answer Deny
<<effects>>
<<set _al to $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel or 0>>
"No," you say. "Nothing unusual."
<br><br>
<<if _al gte 2>>
	<<He>> pulls a photograph from the folder. It shows the maintenance hatch. "This was forced open on the night in question. Whoever did it knew exactly where to find it."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> leans forward. "And our records show you visited this branch seven times in the weeks before the break-in. All at different times. All spending longer than a typical transaction."
	<br><br>
	<<if $english gte 500>>
		<<link [[I was comparing interest rates|Heist Bank Security Answer Good]]>><</link>> <span class="green">English</span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Say nothing more|Heist Bank Security Detained]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<He>> nods and makes a note. "Very well. Thank you for your time."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> opens the door. <span class="purple">The interview felt too easy. Maybe they're waiting for you to make a mistake.</span>
	<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|High Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Heist Bank Security Answer Silent
<<effects>>
<<set _al to $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel or 0>>
You sit in silence. The <<person>> waits. The camera blinks.
<br><br>
<<if _al gte 2>>
	"Silence is noted," <<he>> says. <<He>> presses a button under the desk. The door opens. Two guards enter.
	<br><br>
	"Escort our guest to the holding room. The police will want to speak with <<phim>>."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Heist Bank Security Detained]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	After a very long minute, <<he>> closes the folder. "Thank you for your time." <<His>> tone is cold.
	<br><br>
	You're let out. <span class="pink">That won't be the last time they ask.</span>
	<<stress 12>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|High Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Heist Bank Security Detained
<<effects>>
You're moved to a small room deeper in the building. No windows. The door locks behind you.
<br><br>
Hours pass. Then the police arrive.<<stress 24>><<trauma 18>><<gggstress>><<gggtrauma>>
<br><br>
<span class="red">You've been arrested.</span>
<br><<crimeUp 2000>>
<<link [[Next|Police Prison Intro]]>><<endevent>><<pass 30>><<generatePolice 1>><<generatePolice 2>><</link>>

:: Heist Bank Security Refuse
<<effects>>
"No thank you," you say, turning toward the exit. "I'm in a hurry."
<br><br>
The <<person>> doesn't move. "I see." <<He>> nods to the guards.
<br><br>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 5 "skulduggery">>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	You walk briskly but calmly toward the door. The guards hesitate, unsure if they have the authority to physically stop you. 
	By the time they decide, you're through the door and onto the street.
	<br><br>
	<span class="teal">You left before they could press further. But they know your face now.</span>
	<br><<crimeUp 100>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|High Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	A guard steps into your path. "The officer asked you to stay," <<he>> says.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Follow to the office|Heist Bank Security Questions]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Push past and run|Heist Bank Security Run]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 1000>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Heist Bank Security Caught
<<effects>>
You're led through the service corridor. The same corridor you snuck through. The irony is not lost on you.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Heist Bank Security Detained]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Bank Security Run
<<effects>>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 7 "athletics">>
You shoulder past the guard and sprint for the exit. The marble floor is slippery under your feet.
<br><br>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	<<bankHeistStealthCheck 5 "skulduggery">>
	You burst through the front doors and hit the street running. Pedestrians scatter.
	<br><br>
	<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
		You cut through an alley, vault a low wall, and disappear into the crowd on the next street. <span class="green">Clean escape.</span>
		<<stress -6>><<trauma -3>><<crimeUp 300>>
		<br><br>
		<<set $location to "town">>
		<<destinationeventend>>
	<<else>>
		You make it two blocks before you have to stop, gasping. No one followed. <span class="teal">You're free, for now.</span>
		<<stress 3>><<gstress>><<crimeUp 300>>
		<br><br>
		<<set $location to "town">>
		<<destinationeventend>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Your foot catches on the carpet. You stumble. Two guards pile on before you can recover.
	<<pain 6>><<gpain>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Heist Bank Security Detained]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
